#: src/strings.ts:417
msgid ""
"Use the following key to format the title:\n"
"\n"
"$date$: Current date.\n"
"$time$: Current time.\n"
"$timestamp$: Full date and time without any spaces or other symbols.\n"
"(e.g 202305261253).\n"
"$count$: Number of notes + 1.\n"
"$headline$: Use starting line of the note as title.\n"
"$day$: Current day (eg. Monday)"
msgstr ""
"Use the following key to format the title:\n"
"\n"
"$date$: Current date.\n"
"$time$: Current time.\n"
"$timestamp$: Full date and time without any spaces or other symbols.\n"
"(e.g 202305261253).\n"
"$count$: Number of notes + 1.\n"
"$headline$: Use starting line of the note as title.\n"
"$day$: Current day (eg. Monday)Verwenden Sie die folgenden Schlüssel, um den Titel zu formatieren:\n"
"\n"
"$date$: Aktuelles Datum.\n"
"$time$: Aktuelle Uhrzeit.\n"
"$timestamp$: Vollständiges Datum und Uhrzeit ohne Leerzeichen oder andere Symbole.\n"
"(z. B. 202305261253).\n"
"$count$: Anzahl der Notizen + 1.\n"
"$headline$: Die erste Zeile der Notiz als Titel verwenden.\n"
"$day$: Aktueller Wochentag (z. B. Montag)"

